===Show the photo to Pela and Hook{{subst:void|<!--101150209-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Administrative District|update|You photographed the Everwinter Monument and included Pela and Hook.<br />March 7th seems to be happy with your photography skills... Go ask what the two people in your photo think.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Pela)
----
:'''Hook:''' Whoaaaa! So much ice! But it's warm here... aren't you Overworlders worried it'll melt?
:'''Pela:''' Not at all. It may look like ice, but it's actually a monument carved out of Geomarrow crystal.
:'''Hook:''' Ah, Geomarrow! It's a shame daddy isn't here &mdash; He'd find a buyer for it and sell it for big bucks!
:'''Pela:''' Uh... How do I explain... This particular piece of Geomarrow is definitely not for sale...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Have a look! I took a photo of everyone.
:'''Hook:''' A "photo?" What's that? Hook wants to see it!
:'''Pela:''' I must remind you that taking photos of others without gaining their permission violates Belobog public security ordinance number...
:'''Pela:''' ...Wait, that's a nice picture! And... it's crystal clear.
:'''Hook:''' Wow! Photos are awesome! ...Can Hook have it?
:'''March 7th:''' Hee-hee, you like it? It's yours. A farewell gift from us.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Go to the Neverwinter Workshop and take pictures{{subst:void|<!--101150210-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Neverwinter Workshop|update|The story ended and Bronya succeeded as the Supreme Guardian. The Overworld and Underworld reunited to create a complete Belobog.<br />You bid farewell to Bronya, but March 7th still has some unfulfilled wishes before you leave Jarilo-VI...<br />Take another stroll in the city and record with your camera the people and things you want to commit to memory.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
