:'''Serval:''' Who's there? Didn't your parents tell you to knock before&mdash;
:'''Serval:''' Ha, it's you three! Come on in! I was just talking to Clara about you.
:'''Clara:''' How have you been, {{MC|ж=big sister|м=big brother}}? Miss Serval's workshop is amazing &mdash; there are all kinds of things... I like it here a lot!
:'''Serval:''' "Miss Serval..." Clara is such a well-mannered kid! Meanwhile, the Architects' children are still calling me "auntie" and making me feel old...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's take a photo together!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Still looking to hire assistants for the workshop?
::'''March 7th:''' Hey, that's not your line! We're here to take a photo, remember?
