===Show the photo to Serval and Clara{{subst:void|<!--101150213-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Neverwinter Workshop|update|You took a group photo of Serval and Clara in the workshop.<br />Um, "group photo" means the photo should at least contain the two of them... You do understand this, right?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}


;(Talk to Clara)
----
:'''Serval:''' Wow, that's pretty great! I wish the photographers at my shows had your skills!
:'''Clara:''' Huh...? Am I really that short? I thought...
:'''March 7th:''' Don't worry! If you eat like Dan Heng, you'll be as tall as him one day! *stifled laughter*
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...I'll let that slip.
:'''March 7th:''' Here, keep it... a little farewell gift from the Astral Express.
:'''Serval:''' Huh...? You're leaving so soon?
:'''Serval:''' *sigh* I understand. Well, this photo will always be close to my heart. I'll make a copy for you too, Clara.
:'''Clara:''' Th&mdash;Thanks Miss Serval! {{MC|ж=Big sister|м=Big brother}} (Trailblazer), March, Dan Heng... Thanks for taking care of me. Safe travels.
:'''Clara:''' If you have time... please come back and visit me and Mr. Svarog.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===(Optional) Speak with the Belobog residents{{subst:void|<!--101150215-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

----
:'''March 7th:''' *yawn* ... That's enough sightseeing and photo-taking to last me a while...
:'''March 7th:''' ...Time to head back to the Goethe Hotel for a good night's sleep!
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...We can sleep when we're back on the Express.
:'''March 7th:''' Not so fast! Last time we were here, that evil Madam Guardian interrupted us before we'd gotten the most out of our luxury suites... Don't you think we should make up for it?
:'''March 7th:''' Come onnnn! Himeko and Mr. Yang are grown-ups &mdash; I'm sure they'll cope without us for one night.
:'''March 7th:''' Besides, don't you want to chit-chat with the locals now that Belobog is full of life again? I know I do!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Return to the hotel and rest... with no "surprises" this time!{{subst:void|<!--101150214-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Hotel Room|update|The story ended and Bronya succeeded as the Supreme Guardian. The Overworld and Underworld reunited to create a complete Belobog.<br />You spent your final relaxing time in Belobog. Now is the time to&mdash;<br />&mdash;to return to the hotel and sleep! Um, don't look at me... It's March 7th's idea.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{tx}}
:'''(Trailblazer):''' We should be getting back to the Express. Time to find March and Dan Heng.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Meet up with your friends and prepare to leave{{subst:void|<!--101150220-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Hotel Corridor|update|The story ended, and Bronya succeeded as the Supreme Guardian. The Overworld and Underworld reunited to create a complete Belobog.<br />You spent a calm night at the Goethe Hotel. Though you had an ominous dream, the overall quality of sleep was quite satisfactory.<br />Go meet up with March 7th and Dan Heng. Now you really should get back to the Express.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''March 7th:''' Morning, (Trailblazer)! How did you sleep? I'm full of energy myself!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm full of energy myself!
::'''March 7th:''' ...Copycatitis still has no cure I see.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I dreamed about Sampo...
::'''March 7th:''' You poor thing! I'll go check the lunar calendar &mdash; today might be unlucky.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's time we went home!
::'''March 7th:''' *sigh* But the beds here are so nice!
:'''Dan Heng:''' Did you get Himeko's message? It's time to go. The conductor will nag us again if we put the Express behind schedule.
:'''March 7th:''' Yeah, yeah. Well, pack your souvenirs and stuff. Back home we go!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

