::'''Himeko:''' I'd say it's a solid five stars.
::Piece of cake.
::'''Himeko:''' Confidence goes a long way.
::Can I skip the next mission and get some rest?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Piece of cake.
::'''Himeko:''' Confidence goes a long way.
::Can I skip the next mission and get some rest?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can I skip the next mission and get some rest?
